{"id":"wx2652839830","title":"“中国高被引学者”，华农21人入选！","published_at":"2025-04-11T11:31:53+08:00","published_label":"2025-04-11","cover":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc8LWTg78R0MQFlEbowaicKrOzUkm9CAuPO3ohrQlqRx8jYicAx5Zn6DdDl81y0OsHVYlD6Tc62Wr0ow/0?wx_fmt=jpeg","summary":"近日 爱思唯尔(Elsevier) 正式发布 2024“中国高被引学者” (Highly Cited Chinese Researchers) 榜单 我校有 21位学者上榜 位居全国高校第66名 2024“中国高被引学者”榜单 共计6388…","tags":["校园"],"source":"wechat","original_url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&mid=2652839830&idx=1&sn=2fb6fa469fe629de685fdc80694d7b59","paper_url":null,"word_count":619,"fetched_at":"2026-11-09T16:36:44+08:00","content_html":"<div><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlcib9OUORJLexR67iaNiaHMVsUPnrMCxOs4d75byZVqb9icp60drwxLtIDbs1v6NLBtGH2FfIrVwwNyQmw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p><section><span>近日</span></section><section><span>爱思唯尔(Elsevier) 正式发布</span></section><section><span>2024“中国高被引学者”</span></section><section><span>(Highly Cited Chinese Researchers)</span></section><section><span>榜单<br/></span></section><section><span>我校有</span><span>21位学者上榜</span></section><section><span>位居全国高校第66名</span></section><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc8LWTg78R0MQFlEbowaicKrOJKoG6IfBfhYPaXkBXNG2GVcr8Fib4Ly7xVjhapDc8ic5hPprPkoxJmsQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p><section><span>2024“中国高被引学者”榜单</span></section><p><span>共计6388人上榜</span></p><p><span>来自547所高校、企业及科研机构</span></p><p><span>覆盖了教育部10个学科领域</span></p><section><span>83个一级学科</span></section><p><span>我校入选的21名学者</span></p><p><span>分布在农学、理学、工学学科</span></p><p><span>领域涉及兽医学、作物学、园艺学</span></p><p><span>农业资源与环境、植物保护、生物学</span></p><p><span>农业工程、化学工程与技术等</span></p><p><span>教育部一级学科</span></p><section><span>详细名单如下：</span></section><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc8LWTg78R0MQFlEbowaicKrOBLvbEHrgX2fr7maR12icuXTmicmTasp4DJR6ypHANlHdiceIMy6QGOh1A/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p><p><span>2024“中国高被引学者”榜单以引文与索引数据库Scopus作为中国学者科研成果的统计来源，采用上海软科教育信息咨询有限公司开发的方法，是衡量机构学术影响力的关键标尺之一。据介绍，爱思唯尔致力于深度整合中国科研人才分布与机构学科优势，精准映射高校及科研机构在关键技术领域的核心竞争力，为学科建设与人才战略提供数据驱动的决策支持，揭示高质量研究的选题方向与方法论创新。</span></p><section><span>祝贺所有上榜学者！</span></section><section><span>愿所有华农人<br/></span></section><section><span>再接再厉，争创一流！</span></section><section><img alt=\"图片\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/w4bIWyNFlc9PWVFvMxhxzwtYVAAQQTo2xrCAJlEYZGlyOOhIV6VSjP6OMKrVI2pvs3dRHm2kI0DMqrUc7UOkgA/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;tp=webp\"/></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong>往期回顾</strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652839167&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=4d5b130b8bd0a77247f91457f4a5a2bb&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc8LWTg78R0MQFlEbowaicKrOKNtra3ZRZc9KW5BiavY1NgicmnatR2PIgMHGVvtQ2SlkgL2NgH2g7iahw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></a></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong>/ </strong></span>我在华农当教官！<strong><span>/</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652838946&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=9051b27e71a8f9279d32db17e06dda78&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc8LWTg78R0MQFlEbowaicKrOiaficQVUpXRDLYlic2rL017cVQaYtk44DSZZ15GIhNymZAxXoib5v1wYFg/640?